$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f0> UberPrime\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Cold\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have been fighting over this land for age's, their battling has left the land rittled with holes & no meaning, the only thing worth fighting for now is the honor! Objectives are as fallow's: Capture the enemy's flag & return it to your own flag, Capture the middle objective base & above all, never give up!\n\n<f1>Map Creator: <f0> King Shit{FK} ++Forsaken Knights Leader++\n\n<f1>Dedicated to: <f0> This map was dedicated to the Forsaken Knights clan!\n\n<f1>Thanks: <f0> I would like to also thank the members of Forsaken Knights (for the ones who were there) for all their support in making this map, cause if it wasnt for them then I would have never had enough balls to give this map out, j/k!\n<f1>Come Get Some: <f0>  Check This site weekly for new maps http://www.planetstarsiege.com/catalog/custom_maps.html";
